  "reward_components": [
    "Personal: +0.15 per harvested fruit and +0.5 per delivered fruit",
    "Home farm: +1.2 to each member of the delivering actor's home farm per fruit",
    "Foreign recipient: +0.6 to each member of a different pantry farm per fruit delivered there",
    "Public flow/infrastructure: +0.2 to every actor per first-ever root-bed installation and +0.02 per arriving resource packet, including infected packets",
    "Costs: -0.01 per move/interaction effort, -0.03 per water/compost/seed unit explicitly spent, and -0.08 per crop cure or root cut",
    "Local disease: -0.25 to each member of a farm per crop actually lost there"
  ],
  "reward_bound_derivation": "Each of 32 actors acts once. A loose member bound allows four home deliveries (4.8), 28 foreign deliveries to its pantry (16.8), personal harvest plus delivery (0.8), two initially missing roots (0.4) and all eight packet arrivals (0.16): 22.96, below declared 26. Per-actor negative cost is at worst 0.01 effort plus 0.08 pruning, or 0.01 plus 0.06 construction materials; at most two home plots rot in a tick, adding 0.5. Thus [-2,26] encloses reward. Per-pantry cumulative receipts cannot exceed all 32 actors delivering on all 640 steps, 20480. All other observed quantities and native component values fit [-2,20480].",
